  "You should read the following agreement carefully before clicking on the consent process during the registration process. Please be sure to read and fully understand the terms of the agreement, including:" => "Avant de cliquer sur le programme de consentement pendant le processus d'inscription, vous devriez lire attentivement les accords suivants. Assurez - vous de lire et de bien comprendre les termes du présent Accord, y compris:",
